{"uid": "register_soft-b365e9a77e", "scene": "register_soft", "scene_zh": "委婉缓和", "scene_en": "Softening Language", "group": "语域礼貌", "phase": 10, "micro": "disagreeing", "micro_zh": "表达不同意见", "zh": "我觉得这个方法可能不太合适，有没有其他的选择？", "en": "I wonder if there might be a different approach we could consider?", "sub": "委婉表达不同意见", "angle": "a soft, indirect English sentence that sounds polite", "pack": "register", "pattern": "register_soft", "topic": null, "tags": ["pack::register", "pattern::register_soft", "register::soft"], "model": "qwen2.5:14b", "created_at": "2026-11-20T07:31:25+00:00"}
